  "description": "Create an application for a commercial complex where there are business units. The commercial complex is a coppertaive which is managed by a management committee and a facilities management team \nThe Aim of this portal is to update the happenings/events and notice to the society members\nAllow them to build their profile of the business that there are in , provide for 2 contact numbeber and email so that members can search the portal for any business association and call them up \nThere should be also a provision to raise a business query like does anyone know a lawyer - the same will be forwarded to all the \"lawyers\" in the complex \nThere should be a provision to mention if the owner is using it or it os gives on rent , if given on rent the member can add a contact with email  also it can authorise the tenenat to update the tenant profile - so that the tenant can login also in the portal screen when searched say unit D715 which is on rent and if the owners allowed it will show the companies name in bracket (Tenant ) and then the profile of the tenant \nOn the profile page if the tenenat page comes up , there should be an option to click the owner profile\nMember profile is a must in addition one can have a tenant profile for the unit - only one member profile and tenenat profile is available for the unit number \nIn the profile have a provision to add parking details - like parking slot and vehicle numbers , a unit may have multiple parking slots and multiple cars - multiple cars can be registered to each parking slot \n\nCreate a provision for advertisement banner on the portal this will be banners in a carasole  like fashion with a billing system people can by minimum monthly banner slots and it will be visible in all the portal pages \n\nThere will be types of users , \n1.owners/members\n2.Tenanats ( onklky if rights are provided) - owner should have the authority to delete the tenenat from his unit or remove his login \nManagement team - who have administrative rights to create members and notices , events and so on \n3.Facility team to address the concerns of the members and security \n\nThere are multiple wings and floors and each unit has a unit number \nEach unit has an owner or can have multiple joint owners , there are the the members who will use the \n\nAdd any more feature that you think is required for a smooth functioning of the premise create a provision foe entry of guest in the building also , which will be checked by the security\n\n=== CONFIRMED SCOPE AND COMPLEXITY (user-approved \u2014 this OVERRIDES any conflicting inference from the brief) ===\n* Which functional areas should the application include?\n  - Include: Units & profiles; Business directory; Notices & events; Business queries; Ad banners & billing; Guest entry & security; Facility requests\n  - EXCLUDE (explicitly declined by the user \u2014 do NOT specify these): Maintenance dues\n* How detailed should the first version be?\n  - Include: Standard\n* How should advertising banner booking and billing work?\n  - Include: Simple booking\n* How should guest entry work?\n  - Include: Both\nWrite the specification to cover EXACTLY this confirmed scope at the confirmed complexity level: include every confirmed item, honour every added point, and do not add functional areas, activities or enterprise features beyond it.",
